{
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Filename:       sensor.co2.scd30.spin2
    Description:    Driver for the Sensirion SCD30 CO2 sensor
    Author:         Jesse Burt
    Started:        Jul 21, 2021
    Updated:        May 23, 2025
    Copyright (c) 2025 - See end of file for terms of use.
